    narr:narration """This hub remains a single repeated test assertion rather than a developing narrative. Every child, from [the earliest entry](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1788169170042_1) through [the latest](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_E2EDefaultRef1790588738388_h582f6c72cf26_1), carries [the same statement](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1788255387470_1), re-voiced daily across the span, including [a parallel-series entry](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2E2EDefaultRef1788301640261_1) and [a second one](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2E2EDefaultRef1788341794428_1). The children stay uniform in [conviction and temporal framing](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1789723493710_1) — plain, concrete, present-tense claims — with [one entry carrying a register note](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1789637169682_1) and [a later one repeating that note](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_E2EDefaultRef1790588738388_h582f6c72cf26_1). There is no dissent, no drift, and no substantive variation; a query about anything beyond the repeated assertion should route elsewhere.""" ;
    narr:reaction """Almost nothing moved since the last digest — the hub is still the same uniform repeated assertion, and the prior narration holds as written. The only delta is [one more repetition](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_E2EDefaultRef1790588738388_h582f6c72cf26_1) extending the span, notable only because it repeats the register note seen once before; no tension, drift, or new claim appeared.""" ;
